package CanvasNet {
    part def SpecParser {
        doc /* The internal SpecParser (a sealed partial class with static Parse entry points over text or UTF-8 bytes), the immutable tree types (SpecNode, SpecNodeKind, NodePosition, SpecTree), and the SpecMetadata record: a single-pass Utf8JsonReader-based reader with an explicit frame stack that builds the SpecNode tree with lazily computed RFC 6901 pointers and one-based UTF-16 line and column positions for every value and property key, decodes strictly (invalid UTF-8 in bytes and an unpaired surrogate in text are a located VegaLiteSpecException, never U+FFFD), enforces MaxSourceLength (InvalidDataException), MaxJsonDepth, and MaxStringLength (VegaLiteSpecException), applies the duplicate-key policy (last value wins at the position of the first, one vl-duplicate-key warning), and validates the shape of the known properties of views, titles, padding, autosize, mark definitions, channel definitions, data formats (a single-character delimiter, the parse property and its entries, a sequence field name), scales, and axes with rule tables and generous sets of known property names taken from the Vega-Lite 6 JSON schema (a wrong type or value is a VegaLiteSpecException with the pointer of the value; an unknown key is a vl-unknown-property warning); it rejects a schema naming plain Vega, never walks inline data rows, and visits nested views with an explicit work stack. Phase 5 adds, in the partial file SpecParser.Transforms.cs and the SpecExpressions type, the compilation (with the ExpressionParser unit) of every expression text the renderer evaluates (the expression of a calculate transform, a text filter, and the expr references of a mark property or channel value of the drawn view), whose syntax, length, and depth errors and references to an undeclared parameter are a VegaLiteSpecException located at the expression string with the expression offset in the message; the validation of the variable parameters of every view (a repeated or reserved name, a value or expr of the wrong form, and a dependency cycle located at the expression of the lowest declared parameter on the cycle) with the ParameterGraph that orders the parameters dependencies first; and the shape validation of the supported transforms (calculate, filter and its predicates, fold, flatten, sample, pivot, and lookup) of every view. Phase 6 adds the partial file SpecParser.Aggregates.cs, which validates the shape of the aggregate, joinaggregate, window, bin, stack, and impute transforms (operation names, required fields, parameters such as ntile and nth_value, frames, bin parameters, sort fields, and key sequences) and of the aggregate, bin, stack, sort, and order properties of the channel definitions with located errors, and offers the sort-form helpers (IsSupportedSort, the sort shorthand, and the channel a sort refers to) to the other units. A sort array item that is an object or an array (other than a date-time object on a temporal field) is a located error, an array that mixes kinds of values is the warning vl-encoding-sort-mixed-types, and an unknown key of a sort object is a vl-unknown-property warning. SpecMetadata reads the schema URL and major version, the title text, the marks, the data references, and the parameter names from a tree. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecParser.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecParser.Validation.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecParser.Transforms.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecParser.Aggregates.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecExpressions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecNode.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/SpecMetadata.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/SpecModel/NamespaceDoc.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/SpecModel/SpecParserTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/SpecModel/SpecParserAggregatesTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/spec-model/spec-parser.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/spec-model/spec-parser.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/spec-model/spec-parser.yaml */
    }
}
